Package: cfimport
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: AWS CloudFormation Import Tool
 cfimport automates the process of importing existing AWS resources
 into CloudFormation stacks.
 .
 Features:
  - Scan AWS accounts for existing resources
  - Generate CloudFormation templates using IaC generator
  - Import resources into new or existing stacks
  - Dry-run mode for previewing changes
  - Support for all CloudFormation-importable resource types
